## Anti-Patterns (DO NOT DO)

- ❌ Creating tests in wrong locations
- ❌ Skipping test creation for new code
- ❌ Not adding new model tables to cleanup script
- ❌ Sharing test data between tests
- ❌ Using `require()` in tests
- ❌ Not cleaning database between tests
- ❌ Hardcoding test data
- ❌ Not mocking dependencies properly
